                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I went to Val Verde to see the situation firsthand, and I\u2019m calling on state and local officials to pause operations at the Chiquita Canyon Landfill. This is a health concern and an operation that needs to be stopped until we fully understand it and have a path forward to end it.\n\nEveryone impacted by this issue has my full support at the federal level as we work to mitigate the problem and find solutions.\n\nWe don\u2019t need more studies and reports. We need action and solutions.",
