                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As our kids head back to school, their safety is non-negotiable. That\u2019s why I introduced the Safe Schools Act. This bill allows schools to use unspent COVID relief funds to keep classrooms safe and train teachers to assist students in mental health crises. \n\nI\u2019m committed to taking every constitutional step to ensure our children are protected at school.",
