                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The situation at the Chiquita Canyon Landfill is out of control, and it\u2019s a threat to our community\u2019s health. The operators have been trying to mitigate the emissions, but they still lack root cause and the solution. And the county is not pushing hard enough or sharing data sufficiently to accelerate to a solution.   \n\nWe are breathing this air, and our water is at risk. I\u2019ve demanded a halt to operations except for SCV trash services. And we need a full investigation\u2014no more excuses @ChiquitaFacts and @CountyofLA .\n\nI\u2019ve been pushing hard from the federal level and will continue to do so. But county and state officials need to step up and do their jobs. Our families deserve better.\n\nIf you\u2019re impacted by the issues at Chiquita Canyon Landfill, be sure to check out #9 and #10 in the FAQ section here: https://t.co/V0O4vKYc9x",
                "text_lang": "en",
