                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Chiquita Canyon Landfill situation is still out of control, posing a serious threat to our health. I\u2019ve called for a halt to operations (except SCV trash), a full investigation, and accountability for those responsible. \n\nI've also met with landfill reps to push for a fair relief program and greater transparency. My office is committed to staying involved until this is resolved. County and state leaders need to step up and do their part as well\u2014our community deserves better.",
