                "quoted_status_profile_username": "GavinNewsom",
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": ".@GavinNewsom, I support you in declaring a State of Emergency in response to these wildfires.\u00a0Will you support the people of North LA County by declaring a State of Emergency to address the ongoing environmental and health disaster at Chiquita Canyon landfill?\n\nResidents of Val Verde, Castaic and West SCV \u2014 please repost and tell your neighbors. The Governor and local officials must take the next step by declaring a State of Emergency!\n\n@Pilar4CA @LACountyBOS",
