                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Stopped by the Samuel Dixon Family Health Center in Val Verde to learn about their efforts to expand healthcare, thanks to a $600,000 federal grant for behavioral health services. \n\nWe also talked about the health challenges posed by the Chiquita Canyon landfill. \n\nI\u2019m committed to supporting providers like Samuel Dixon who are stepping up for our community.",
