                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans shouldn\u2019t have to question election results. That\u2019s why I introduced the Voter ID Act (H.R. 5189). \n\nIt\u2019s simple\u2014if you need an ID to buy cold medicine and board a plane, you should need one to vote. \n\nLet\u2019s secure our elections, strengthen election security, and restore trust.",
