                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Chiquita Canyon landfill crisis is a public health emergency\u2014not just an odor issue. \n\nSince last year, I\u2019ve been fully engaged, from bringing in the EPA to pushing for a State of Emergency with bipartisan support. I\u2019ve called for a suspension of operations, urgent public health testing, and real accountability for every agency involved. \n\nFamilies deserve answers and immediate action, and I won\u2019t stop fighting until we see both from the county.\n\nWatch my remarks from this week's Chiquita Canyon Landfill Community Advisory Committee meeting below \ud83d\udc47\n\nhttps://t.co/ylr1VvXjtu",
